# Local scratch — large binaries with no in-repo references (checked: nothing
# in the tree links to either, so ignoring them breaks no doc or asset).
Update_Cy.png
cyber-security.pdf

# A working clone of the VibeMart demo target. This is its OWN git repository
# (remote: Punya23/cyphex-vibemart-demo), so git cannot track its contents from
# here anyway — staging it would silently record a gitlink, not the files.
# The path is anchored with a leading slash on purpose: an unanchored
# `vibemart/` would also match demo/vibemart, which IS a tracked gitlink.
# cx.py's help text still suggests `/scan ./vibemart`, so keep the directory
# locally — just don't commit it.
/vibemart/
